      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "97d2cba4-82ad-4fa8-8e90-cb9918f8a9c6"],
     ", a bounded or absent count to ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Greedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "fac1dd94-ab2d-43d8-87c5-2d68cea903db"],
     ". The class is the same under every value; ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Greedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "a7850cc0-dd88-4d4f-aa2b-7a6112bf8334"],
     " and ",
