    "A10, Euclid's axiom", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "5653b097-701c-4047-a90f-bb9dde98f573"], Cell["\<\
The Euclidean axiom, stated with betweenness and equidistance.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"d23b517e-6b15-48a5-a407-70060d59d904"]}
  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"1dd20e84-32da-4049-b324-\
